	measure 'EPOS P Value Dynamic' = ```
			VAR SelectedMode = SELECTEDVALUE ( 'PeriodMode'[Mode], "YTD" )
			RETURN
			    SWITCH (
			        SelectedMode,
			        "YTD", [EPOS P Value YTD],
			        "MAT", [EPOS P Value MAT],
			        [EPOS P Value Custom]
			    )
			
			```
		displayFolder: EPOS P value share
